[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4802.229, "timestamp": "01:20:02", "text": "哇，这里面包含的东西真多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4805.83, "timestamp": "01:20:05", "text": "游戏。真让我难过得想哭。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4808.229, "timestamp": "01:20:08", "text": "我的天，这里有修改功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4811.189, "timestamp": "01:20:11", "text": "这是什么？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4813.11, "timestamp": "01:20:13", "text": "散热器、压缩机，它们都是零件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4816.229, "timestamp": "01:20:16", "text": "飞机。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4818.55, "timestamp": "01:20:18", "text": "哦，你可以免费查到。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4820.229, "timestamp": "01:20:20", "text": "一次只能研究一个。所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4822.229, "timestamp": "01:20:22", "text": "现在，你只是在两者之间跳来跳去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4824.149, "timestamp": "01:20:24", "text": "就像点击一个，然后让它运行一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4826.39, "timestamp": "01:20:26", "text": "是。你看到那根横杆了吗？对于每个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4828.35, "timestamp": "01:20:28", "text": "正方形。是的。对不起。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4830.87, "timestamp": "01:20:30", "text": "矩形框填充完毕后，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4833.59, "timestamp": "01:20:33", "text": "可以买。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4837.35, "timestamp": "01:20:37", "text": "啊，现在科研标志是一个灯泡"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4839.83, "timestamp": "01:20:39", "text": "货币符号是银狮。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4842.87, "timestamp": "01:20:42", "text": "徽。是的，你看到银狮了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4845.99, "timestamp": "01:20:45", "text": "顶部有标志。嗯。你有56,000"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4855.27, "timestamp": "01:20:55", "text": "我是富有还是穷得叮当响？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4858.709, "timestamp": "01:20:58", "text": "你是初级水平。"}]